Package: mars-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${perl:Depends}, make, gcc, perl, kmod
Recommends: mars-tools
Suggests: clang, llvm, lld, mokutil
Description: mars kernel module.
 MARS Light is a block-level storage replication solution implemented
 in the form of a Linux kernel module.
 .
 Writes are recorded in transaction logs and replicated asynchronously
 to remote block devices. Local durability does not imply that a
 secondary has received or applied an acknowledged write.

